Package: Friedman
Title: Tools for Exploring the MASS Birth Weight Dataset
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Avery", "Lane", , "aglane@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is meant to make it easier to explore and understand
    the birth weight dataset from the MASS library. It includes simple functions
    to clean the data, summarize it, and create quick visualizations. The goal 
    is to provide a clear way to use basic data analysis skills and learn how 
    different factors may relate to birth weight, without having to start 
    completely from scratch.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
